    "rating": 3.5,
    "reference": "ChIJ-el70n1IyUwRzp3tnCMXyig",
    "reviews": [
      {
        "author_name": "Stephen Adams",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/106110664153316648814/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocJSpRpwtNkCvdPgdNMuwq1Ydp-RB9F7UdqgMLfaLP_a-vHHjA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba2",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "2024 - Yearly review at Club de Golf Vaudreuil.  Finally got my 1st round in today at the course.  Course is in great shape and the 10th green that was re-done a few years ago is maturing well.  Always a baby fade to the far left to hold that green.  Tough shot, but entertaining.  Couple of fairway dry spots, but mostly due to the weather.  As the season progresses, these areas should become lusher.  Overall, in very good condition and always a pleasure running into the staff.  Thanks again for a great day.\n2023 - Thought I would update my Review from last year.  Course is in even better condition.  Lusher fairways, greens in great condition and overall a great golf track - some changes to the look of the course as many trees were removed last year due to disease (as with many other clubs).  I can see that Management continues to invest in overall improvement.  👍👍👍\n2022 - I play here regularly... Better condition than ever, some tight fairways and their greens are spectacular - they roll true... Lots of fun for any level of golfer... 🏌️⛳😁",
        "time": 1718596183,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Sandra C.",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/114337719271075651864/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocKFUkLAZ81XVnEiMcG_rlJHHCL_AuWw8AFEoTYO6DZHWvx-Hg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "7 months ago",
        "text": "First time playing on this course. We went early and was able to play just us (which is very appreciated for a beginner!). Course was very well maintained and staff was friendly. Definitely will be back!",
        "time": 1752525611,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Bradley Wilkerson",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/101211939312992960213/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocIvy6XeI0CElXF059rLf52roAqc_CFToXvTBX-o_36cpi-hcQ=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "Value is unbeatable in the area. Very courteous staff and the conditions are very good considering the heat and drought of the month of August.\n\nAs for the people complaining about dress codes and very basic rules about 1x bag per player, we don't want you or need you playing here.",
        "time": 1756837809,
        "translated": false
      },
