        "relative_time_description": "6 months ago",
        "text": "This past SUNDAY, Myself, my buddy and our sons decided to continue a tradition we started last year, a father son golf game, we are NOT good golfers, we do it for fun and exercise. We booked at CLUB de GOLF VAUDREUIL.\nAfter 2 shots on the 1st hole we were approached by the Marshal who suggested we play BEST BALL….we told him that’s what we were doing, and played on. At Hole #3, there was our marshal buddy again, watching us from across the fairway. I approached him and politely asked him if he was going to be following us all day.\nHe told me we were doing okay, the group ahead of us were on their green when we arrived at the tee so we were NOT really behind, but his BOSS was pushing him.\nAt hole #5 is where the wheels came off. Our sons both shanked theirs into the rough maybe 50 yards away, as my son was getting ready to hit, he and I both saw the marshal once again giving us the “hurry up” signal. My son started bitching and swearing out loud, I tried to calm him down a bit, but honestly I was also fed up…we had been hounded since the first hole, non-stop, and enough was enough. My son approached his ball angrily and just slapped it 20-30 yards continuing his rant at which point he was approached by a “gentleman” inquiring what the problem was.\nThat person who was FAR from a gentleman, was SERGE BERNIER, he is apparently the owner of the course. When we explained ourselves he just replied that we were indeed taking too long and were 2 holes behind which was not true as I explained that on the last hole the golfers in front of us were still on the green when we arrived at the tee.\nMr. Bernier was RUDE, AGGRESSIVE and I felt some anti- anglo vibes from him, even though I spoke to him in French at one point…funny enough, while reading other complaints on GOOGLE, several others had the same comments.\nMr. Bernier continued with his disrespectful, aggressive, narcissistic attitude, and after my son told him we were not PRO golfers, just 2 sons and their DAD’S having a day of golf together, he told my son “IF YOU ARE NOT A GOOD GOLFER YOU SHOULD NOT PLAY ON THE WEEKENDS”. This was where I stepped in, we exchanged a few unpleasantries….he then exploded TOLD US TO GO AND GET OUR MONEY BACK AND GET OFF HIS GOLF COURSE. The worst thing is, his marshal warned me 2 holes before that the OWNER was 2 groups behind, and if he came to see us he would do JUST THAT.\nWe had enough of his shitty disrespectful, attitude, so we got our money and left and will never go back again…I want others to know about this and be prepared for it…or…spend your hard earned money at a course where they will appreciate your business and treat you properly. I have a personal message for MR BERNIER but there is a character limit on these posts, so it will follow this one on a different post.",
